03", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003251_774312788169636_8407136546126498352_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AKxuNxs0aR8Q7kNvwGSqfEd&_nc_oc=AdqRe5_uUz_XUKhEmu3kkyUiAJa1pFedjsS13H-4mH4QxXTr4PdOf2x_WvTvSGHCIdk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAc059CLcbrK5fENie0f3lV5nHmf79uatPOQWRtSSEfgg&oe=6A4E4526"}]}, "id": "1377969980485338", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "SC26.png", "id": "964420118677466", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031510_964420125344132_7279037948266946186_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9curRwDFnG0Q7kNvwGDaRl8&_nc_oc=AdpdwBVPAQXIrL6I5e_4kN523yVmT0-bD6wE3LWusx0I621tjzVS4oWz6fvhaIGDUKQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBS6fMXh50ceJqoZCcRtN-jqdHe0hRpp-qkxiY8jdoOeA&oe=6A4E5045"}, {"file_name": "SC19.png", "id": "1028550412168366", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031459_1028550415501699_7667063941983084531_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VtzsZE25dVMQ7kNvwEuBi8p&_nc_oc=AdrnXVuuyziNr5zynaERHwowQpuP9g6af50Hj9doRsIWz0sjfDJLPZ-y-MTp-4DRsLA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCQkN851ujEx55Ie-6xC4g8f5YmwrAo7s1ypWZ1i-xaQg&oe=6A4E4DEC"}, {"file_name": "SC6.png", "id": "1213008986735069", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982453_1213008990068402_721949442093583782_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vmrYCd6DxNAQ7kNvwFVhRVb&_nc_oc=AdprT79PR9MovAjBqaXzJTTz0lg-_hN3BDVLFFvM8eoVQJe1TwzyJ8m_14RdLL9sYcQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC2GPTwORNDKQXickad0vtDfwXFcxH4bn6_ibQRw6uxAQ&oe=6A4E61A0"}, {"file_name": "SC25.png", "id": "2182709462063835", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031547_2182709465397168_1136481695964559917_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7BKDFHS0bfoQ7kNvwFyiMQb&_nc_oc=Adq9eeoGm37k8uApptua8rTbx6e0N6a1yHZX92zO5c7NA6UCq9yP-n4Zait19qQgvGU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQClWkC7hAt8cgLHWEMx02MI3enuyYe0DCD3F1j2E9ozfQ&oe=6A4E56B6"}, {"file_name": "SC11.png", "id": "1020526033014243", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75250452_1020526036347576_3573329723363051043_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=grvOvXyv8I8Q7kNvwEVWelL&_nc_oc=Adonv-mBPfXQqtPpAz1UX-KLteNWk2KM9Q907ZTqW1wuq6cUkx8sgx-fMTFZ8K0wVio&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDKtjxJKl_RB-QdiHQjywL2fW4UrujejTqGGO0sS0iHkg&oe=6A4E4C2F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TrailerCover.png", "id": "1670277503511368", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974650_1670277506844701_2413630122857125207_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=izMp6fGzVPsQ7kNvwFwAFRd&_nc_oc=Adqt2DKkwvjKrBHXft4W6yoy55IunJrC4CVlqMwnnD2HJHFD5y_ctZpdvxfvz6Ckr-E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDKMsVcZAUQP4cF7q5GHHhBCnyWpXgYOPf4WkZrvgOOXA&oe=6A4E5CD5"}, "display_name": "Venture's Gauntlet: Ultimate VR Fitness", "keywords": ["fitness", "adventure", "obstacle", "story", "platformer"], "long_description": "# VR's Ultimate Action-Platformer\n\nObsessed with his family's legacy, aging billionaire Adam Venture is looking for a capable heir to the Venture name and fortune. His only requirement? The skill and tenacity to overcome a series of deadly obstacle courses known as: **Venture\u2019s Gauntlet**\n\n{960204795511693}\n\n# Comfortable Locomotion \n\nRun, climb, swing and zipline your way through the gauntlet in comfort and style with **TrueMotionVR** arm swing controls.\n\n\n# Overcome Dangerous Challenges\n\nKiller-drones, deadly lasers, fatal drops and more all stand along the path to glory. Only the most capable will survive.\n\n{472666925095689}\n\n# Embark On An Epic Journey\n\nTraverse giant cliffs, delve into the depths of the earth and climb crumbling castles across 9 intense stages inspired by the Highlands of Scotland.\n\n{2173852816328585}\n\n# Breathtaking Visuals\n\nExperience beautiful graphics powered by Unreal Engine. A dynamic time of day and weather system makes the world feel alive as you progress through the Gauntlet.\n\n{408266168650091}\n\n# Uncover the secrets of the Ventures\n\nThe ever-present Adam Venture watches your every move. Do you have the skill to impress him, or will you be a disappointment like all the others?\n\n{1446632349279537}\n\n# Tailor Made Courses\n\nCalibration adjusts the Gauntlet\u2019s obstacles to your height & arm length measurements to ensure the best experience for all users.\n\n# Claim the ultimate glory\n\nCompete against other players for the best times on each stage on the online leaderboards.\n\nSo ask yourself this -  do **YOU** have what it takes to run the Gauntlet?\n\nWe think you can do it!!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "Venture\u2019s Gauntlet is an intense parkour & obstacle course game that features arm swing movement, climbing, archery, moving lasers, shooter drones, shields, and more.  \n\nPlaying the game is an immersive physical experience, a test of both fitness and skill because you are the one running, climbing, and dodging through challenging courses!  \n\nKiller-drones, deadly lasers, fatal drops and more all stand along the path to glory. Only the most capable will survive and claim Adam Venture's fortune.\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bearhammergames.com/privacypolicy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://bearhammergames.com/eula/", "publisher_name": "BearHammer Games Ltd", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bearhammergames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id"